{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415484","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415484","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041548401:1":{"text":"哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。","source_cn":"哎呀，真是糟糕的温度。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEADCDE2910A28BD9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041548402:1":{"text":"可惜不能在这里降下一场大雪，不然，冻结的火焰一定会很美吧。","source_cn":"可惜不能在这里降下一场大雪，不然，冻结的火焰一定会很美吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC667C7DB21B69AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041548403:1":{"text":"这话应该我来说。","source_cn":"这话应该我来说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E1311A2C24A1A21","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041548404:1":{"text":"如果不是看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，你早就在阳炎下融化成水汽了，恶魔！","source_cn":"如果不是看在<style=stress><player...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD72674C52E51B4D6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"如果不是看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，你早就在阳炎下融化成水汽了，恶魔！","female":"如果不是看在<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>的面子上，你早就在阳炎下融化成水汽了，恶魔！","variant_male_record_index":"251238","variant_female_record_index":"251239","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041548405:1":{"text":"要来对战游戏吗？好啊，这里只有围在圆桌旁的长谈，可无聊呢。","source_cn":"要来对战游戏吗？好啊，这里只有围在圆桌旁的长谈，可无聊呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89FDE6D2ECE2CF0E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041548406:1":{"text":"干脆来试试吧。我很好奇，你的火焰被冻结在冰里会是什么样子——就像那位曾经受人敬仰的战争女英雄一样，她的冰雕中也燃烧着魔法的火焰。","source_cn":"干脆来试试吧。我很好奇，你的火焰被冻结在冰里会是什么样...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A708F0A40DEA35B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041548407:1":{"text":"会像围困在琥珀里的虫子一样吗？还是像想要挣脱出牢笼的飞鸟呢？","source_cn":"会像围困在琥珀里的虫子一样吗？还是像想要挣脱出牢笼的飞鸟呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1158A7336C2BEAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041548408:1":{"text":"是吗？我的火焰将烧尽你无知的自负。","source_cn":"是吗？我的火焰将烧尽你无知的自负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED859C0B38856A3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041548409:1":{"text":"不要用玩乐的语调吐出残忍的词语，恶魔，你把生命看作什么？仅仅是一场游戏吗？","source_cn":"不要用玩乐的语调吐出残忍的词语，恶魔，你把生命看作什么...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AC00A8F9F2CABBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041548410:1":{"text":"能成为游乐项目之一，不是很好吗？","source_cn":"能成为游乐项目之一，不是很好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF835EC540D88CFC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041548411:1":{"text":"你的目光里满是仇恨，没人说过用那种目光打量别人很没礼貌吗？","source_cn":"你的目光里满是仇恨，没人说过用那种目光打量别人很没礼貌吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4FA97AD0BEB09D4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041548412:1":{"text":"对待你这种恶魔，做出任何礼数都是对神明的亵渎！","source_cn":"对待你这种恶魔，做出任何礼数都是对神明的亵渎！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD967B73B22281E8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041548413:1":{"text":"呀，那就太有趣了。要是有亵渎神明的机会，一定要叫上我哦，我绝对不想错过。","source_cn":"呀，那就太有趣了。要是有亵渎神明的机会，一定要叫上我哦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB905DCE539180201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蒂斯妮娅":{"text":"蒂斯妮娅","source":"蒂斯妮娅","status":"source"},"speaker:塔琳":{"text":"塔琳","source":"塔琳","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}